
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <h2>Welcome to Laundrix, {{name}}!</h2>

    <p>
      Thank you for creating your Laundrix account.
    </p>

    <p>
      Please enter the following verification code
      on the Laundrix verification page:
    </p>

    <h1 style="letter-spacing: 8px; color: #222;">
      {{verificationCode}}
    </h1>

    <p>
      This code will expire in 1 hour.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you did not create this account, you can
      safely ignore this email.
    </p>

    <p>Thank you,<br />The Laundrix Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
